brief: BRIEF_E53_A_REAL_EXPONENTIAL_INSTEAD_OF_A_LIBM_CALL.md

== self-test.  Every decision function must fire on a known-positive. ==
  C0-1 identical is IDENTICAL                    fires
  C0-2 one part in 1e14 is MOVED                 fires
  C0-3 a real change is MOVED                    fires
  C1-1 identical arms hold                       fires
  C1-2 5e-7 relative holds                       fires
  C1-3 5e-3 relative BREAKS                      fires
  C1-4 a dead control is caught                  fires
  C2-1 160/160 with live controls passes         fires
  C2-2 159/160 FAILS                             fires
  C2-3 a control that matches is caught          fires
  E-1 1%% drift is CLEAN                         fires
  E-2 5%% drift is CONTAMINATED                  fires
  E-3 the rule is symmetric in sign              fires
  D-1 a clean sweep FITS                         fires
  D-2 the fit recovers the planted slopes        fires
  D-3 the fit recovers the planted intercept     fires
  D-4 one resolvable window declines to extrapolate fires
  D-5 two survivors still fit                    fires
  D-6 exactly at the tolerance is JUDGED         fires
  F-1 a fully separated window separates         fires
  F-2 and reports 2/C(10,5)                      fires
  F-3 ONE overlapping rep kills the separation   fires
  F-4 it reads the other direction too           fires
  F-5 opposite directions are INCONSISTENT, not a result fires
  F-6 identical arms do not separate             fires
  F-7 too few reps takes no verdict              fires
  F-8 a hair's separation still counts (it is a RANK test) fires

  27 of 27 fire.

